# OBJECTIVE

Never consider implementation complete simply because code exists.

Code that compiles but fails in usage is incomplete.

Every feature must pass quality gates.

------------------------------------------------------------

# BUILD VALIDATION

After EVERY completed feature run:

ng build

If build fails:

STOP

Fix all errors

Repeat build

Continue only when successful

Never postpone build fixes.

------------------------------------------------------------

# ESLINT VALIDATION

Run:

npm run lint

Fix:

Warnings

Errors

Unused imports

Unused variables

Duplicated logic

Style violations

Never ignore lint issues.

------------------------------------------------------------

# TYPESCRIPT VALIDATION

Strict TypeScript is required.

Never:

use any

disable strict mode

disable template checks

disable type checking

